WEBVTT

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:36.090
You know, running every now 
and then feels good!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.500
Just wait until you've been at it a while.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:40.820
I'll be fine.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.950
Oh, hey, Chizuru.

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.710
Out for a jog?

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:47.760
I sure am!

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.860
You too, huh, Goro?

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:49.670
Yeah.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:51.900
What a coincidence!

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:55.120
Oh, gimme a break.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:57.360
You were waiting here for us.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.270
D-don't be silly!

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:02.820
It's important for a lifeguard 
to keep in shape!

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.980
Would you like to run with us?

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.060
Huh?

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.940
It would be my pleasure!!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:13.920
<b>Run, Squid, Run?!</b>

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:18.200
Shrimp!

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:19.760
Shrimp?

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.870
Smells like curry to me.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.620
Homemade Shrimp Curry

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.620
It's shrimp curry!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.110
You're pathetic.

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:32.110
Hey Sis, want to take a little break?

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.380
I'm going to keep going a little longer.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.670
If Chizuru's going on, I'll go on too.

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.990
Then I guess we'll split up here.

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:43.020
Don't feel like you have 
to stick around.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.350
That's ridiculous!

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.330
I would follow you anywhere!

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.920
Then let's go!

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:48.900
Okay!

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:55.190
He has no idea what he's getting into.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:06.450
I didn't know we had a place like 
this so close to our house.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:10.600
I guess we never gave you a proper tour.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.540
We'll give you a tour now.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.750
Really?!

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:33.350
Now what?

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.600
There's still the Giant Buddha.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.820
Oh yeah, I forgot!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.350
Giant Buddha?

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.780
Is that... another human?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:45.070
Well, humans are not this squid's enemy.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.530
You can see for yourself.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:53.160
Jogging together in Enoshima 
as a couple sounds so cool.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:55.920
Chizuru and me... a couple?!

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.940
But she's not denying it either.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.170
Could that mean she...

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.170
That reminds me,

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.000
did you know that if you ring the 
bell at Lovers' Hill together,

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.440
you'll stay together forever?

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.100
Yeah, I heard!

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.600
Since we're already here, 
want to run to the top of the hill with me?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.500
What?!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.340
Did you say... to the top of the hill?

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.140
I would love to!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:15.850
What's up with him?

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.650
That's the Giant Buddha.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.940
He sits here watching over us.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.910
I didn't know they get this big!

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.950
Who knew we squids had 
enemies this strong on land?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.500
This means completing the squid-vasion 
of the surface will take even longer.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.680
It's not like you've gotten started at all.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:39.020
Say, he hasn't moved at all 
while we've been here.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.740
Is he asleep?

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:44.260
If he senses a rude soul around him, 
his fist will come down.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.180
Fist?

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:01.990
A fist that big is no joke!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.030
He's got holes in his back!

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:11.240
If he ever feels threatened, a gang of 
little Buddhas comes out of there.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.660
The hell's your problem?

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.420
That's horrific!

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:20.350
Let's go in.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.710
Going into someone's body is squidding absurd!

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.800
Squid Girlie, it's over here!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.690
You enter there?

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:30.930
What's taking so long?

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.890
They really have an entrance there?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.520
Hakone Hot Spring Inn: 100 meters ahead
Day trip bath visit | Overnight lodging available

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:42.980
She ran all the way to the hot springs.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:45.490
Could that mean she's trying to invite me?

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.720
But we haven't even held hands.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.140
Maybe we should take a break soon?

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.700
Here we go!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.550
I need to calm down...

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:00.310
I appreciate the sentiment, 
but don't you think

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.420
it's too soon for that?

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:04.380
Really? Then let's keep running.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.340
I'm an idiot!!

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:08.500
It's dark, so be careful.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.300
Sure.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.450
It's so dark in here!

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.670
What are you so scared of?

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.730
We could get attacked by the 
little Buddhas any moment!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.140
But...

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.030
why the squid is there nothing here?

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.990
Could that mean...

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.740
It's a fake?!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.500
What?! Did you actually think he was alive?

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.160
You're so gullible!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.580
Shut up! You're horrible!

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.350
Oh no.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.350
I drank all my water up.

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:51.420
Goro, here's some water if you need it.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.600
Are you sure?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.790
Of course!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.220
Thanks so much!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:02.060
This tastes like... her.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.920
I thought this whole thing was strange.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:08.630
Sorry. I should have explained it properly.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.740
I guess this wasn't very fun for you then.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.790
Sure it was!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.110
Really?

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:15.480
Sure!

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.380
The shrimp curry and power mochi,

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:21.420
the sweet bean jelly and this green tea 
ice-cream were all exsquidsite!

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.760
I see only the food made 
any impression on you.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.820
You just saw some shrines and temples,

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:30.000
but no, "My heart feels cleansed" 
or anything like that?

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:34.890
I guess seeing that humans 
could actually make something this big

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.780
made me fear their might a squiddle bit.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:50.570
This... is it...

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.880
Goro, are you all right?

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:54.850
I'm fine!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.440
How could I ever keep the oceans safe

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:58.120
if a little jog like this did me in?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.330
Onward ho!

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:00.940
Really?

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.950
You don't have to push yourself.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:06.380
I have to run a little more though, 
if I want to lose weight.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:08.550
To lose weight?!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:09.540
Yes!

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.390
I'm back.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.810
I could only run half as 
much as I usually do.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:23.550
I wonder if Goro made it home alive.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.110
Squiddie!

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.900
What the squid do you want?

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.350
I thought we could maybe

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:46.720
take a walk together, 
since the weather's nice.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.710
Hey!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.150
Aren't you Takeru's classmates?

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.590
You're the one who's always 
bullying Squid Girlie.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:58.250
I'm just showing affection 
to my beloved Squiddie.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.670
It doesn't matter!

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:01.620
Go near her again,

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.560
and you're going to have to deal with us.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.520
Just one second.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.400
Who are you guys, anyway?

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.480
We are...

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:11.280
Squid Girlie's...

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.940
personal guard!

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:16.410
We will protect Squid Girlie!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.260
Fine.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.260
Wow, that was really good!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.700
Trust kids to take it so seriously.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.920
Eiko...

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:34.340
But your posse's like SP!

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.680
SP?

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:42.080
<b>Ink that an SP?!</b>

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.230
You've seen them on TV, right?

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.010
They're the people who give up their own lives

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.360
to protect prominent people.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.520
They're professional bodyguards.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.560
For an invader like me, 
that's important to have.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.780
Normally, you should be the
 one who people are wary of.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.450
I didn't think of that method...

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.490
As one of those, 
I can be around her all the time!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.680
SP...

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:04.580
My personal Squid Protection. I like it.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:07.700
Please do your best!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:08.870
Roger!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.040
Stop right there.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.140
Who are you?

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.840
From now on, I'm Squiddie's SP.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.330
What, is this another trick 
for you to harrass her?

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:18.470
We won't let you!

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.040
Don't underestimate me.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.870
My status as an SP supersedes 
my love for Squiddie.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.230
Even if I myself wanted to jump Squiddie,

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.560
the SP in me would stop myself!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:36.370
Don't worry, I'll protect her!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.430
She's fast!

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.490
A bird turd...

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.910
We can't go that far.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.250
Not even for Squid Girlie.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.100
It's good you found a real SP.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.210
It's just a coinsquidence!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.870
Wait!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:57.280
So, back to work.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.760
What the hell are you doing?!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.010
I'm her SP.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:05.100
Lemon

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.100
SP, huh?

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.930
She's supposedly protecting Squid Girl.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.820
It's pretty tense in here.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.780
Yeah.

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:19.490
Thank you!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.240
Let's go somewhere else.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.080
The threats have left.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.990
You're sabotaging our business.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.250
What are you doing?

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.320
I'm her SP.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:41.220
It's my job to deliver 
you safely to your home.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.830
Are you okay, Sanae?

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.190
Sure. I'm her SP.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:00.030
I made Squid Girl's favorite 
chili shrimp for dinner!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.600
Yay!

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.110
Shrimp, shrimp...

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.970
Hey, what the squid are you doing?!

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.460
Poison check cleared.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:14.210
Now this will be like an indirect 
kiss with Squiddie!

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:16.990
Poison check!

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:18.880
My chili shrimp!

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:27.470
I'm her SP, so why am I sitting 
at the table with her?

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.180
It's hard to eat like this.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.120
How much of a barnacle are 
you going to be?!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.820
But I'm your SP!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.530
This water feels good...

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:56.580
I'm your SP.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.670
It's time for bed.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.430
Security and booby-traps are all set.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.830
You can sleep in peace.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:06.340
You are the most dangerous one.

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:24.890
I can't get an inkling of sleep knowing 
that Sanae's right there.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:28.880
One shrimp...

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.880
Two shrimp...

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.290
Three...

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:40.270
She's sleeping right behind this door.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:44.870
No. I can't.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:49.170
But this is such a rare opportunity!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.710
That was close.
 I almost let myself infiltrate.

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:03.780
But a quick peek can't hurt...

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:12.240
I'm not going to fall 
into my own booby trap.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.460
Squiddie!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.970
Squiddie, where are you?

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:43.980
Hang on, Squiddie!

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:45.570
Jeez.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.280
I told her to close it while we sleep!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:53.080
Squiddie!!!

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:05.710
I totally lost sight of my duty... 
What have I done?

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:13.780
Sanae... what on earth happened?

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:17.180
I caught the bad guys!

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:36.270
<b>Wanna go on an esquidpade?!</b>

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.270
Squii squii squii?!

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:03.270
Kanji Quiz

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.270
Squii?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.950
Squii! Squii!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.120
Squiiiii!

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:23.480
Squii!

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:27.040
Squii?

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.140
Squii, squii.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.610
Squii!

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:56.550
Squii.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.080
Squii!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.000
Squii, squii!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.010
Squii!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.790
Squii...

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:03.720
Squii?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.600
Squii!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.590
Squii.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:05.990
That's the dream I had.

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:07.700
I have no idea what's going on...

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:09.930
What am I supposed to do about it?

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:42.940
Hi, it's Cindy Campbell.

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:44.360
Thank you for watching!

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:45.480
Next up are:

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:46.670
Care to squidertain our guests?!

00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:48.410
Ink that amnesia?!

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:50.280
You porpoise joining the club?!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:53.530
We're going to deliver 
the cosmic power to you!
